      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "1. Set your key in **ComfyUI menu → Extensions → OpenRouter → OpenRouter settings**.\n2. Upload the photo in **Product Photo** and describe the campaign in **Campaign**.\n3. Press **Run**. The edited image is saved under `campaign/approved` or `campaign/review`."
      ],
      "title": "Start Here"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "pos": [
